        "parameters": "[{\"name\": \"d\", \"type\": \"Directory\", \"required\": true, \"description\": \"the record\"}, {\"name\": \"r\", \"type\": \"TicketRequest\", \"required\": true, \"description\": \"the team's request\"}]",
        "purpose": "Adapter.ticket_draft: a team's work-ticket draft as a Jira Task issue create body (Cloud v3 ADF / DC v2 wiki), how to file it, and problems naming the setting to give; body None when site, project, issue type or routing field is unmapped",
