    {
      "attributes": {
        "description": "Package opsdir-adapter-jira-sm only. (1) Adapter.ticket_draft: body = POST /rest/api/3/issue (Cloud, description in ADF: heading, bullet list of findings) or /rest/api/2/issue (Data Center, wiki-markup string), chosen by the same Cloud/DC distinction the collector already makes (or a setting); fields project {key}, issuetype {id}, summary, description, duedate (YYYY-MM-DD earliest do-by), optional priority id, optional mapped team field; settings without defaults: jira-sm-ticket-projects ('<team>=<project key>[:<team field value>]' or similar), jira-sm-ticket-issue-type (issue type id), jira-sm-ticket-fields (extra defaults); missing -> problems naming the setting. how = request line + curl with placeholders (Cloud Basic email:api-token, DC PAT bearer, AGC gateway note). (2) Read-back: a linked key that is a work ticket (issue type not a change type / or per mapping) is read as ciamTicketKind=work with duedate -> ciamTicketDue; states through jira-sm-status-states as today; no approval. Unit tests. README.",
        "name": "612c Jira SM: work-ticket draft (Task issue, Cloud ADF / DC wiki) + read-back",
        "parent": {
          "slug": "task-my-area-rest-mine-on-fix-lists-and-the-a-d398dc8e"
